Hello, long time no see, right? Anyway, I found a way to store tiles in an array struct to form the fossil rocks and the fossils inside for my RPG Maker MZ Love letter to the Fossil Fighters series, Dragon Bones. All I need to know is how you draw them from an array struct using a JS Draw Code. I plan to do it similarly to how the CCG Plugin was programmed. In this case, I plan to use notes created directly from my plugin.
Below is the code I'm currently using for the plugin, credit goes to ct_bolt for giving me the template to help me get started.
